      "content": "This section introduces JSON, JSON Schema and work\nrelated to schema creation, schema mapping, large language\nmodels (LLMs) and prompt engineering.\n1https://github.com/MetaConfigurator/meta-configurator\narXiv:2508.05192v2  [cs.SE]  16 Jan 2026",
